---
import '../styles/global.css';
import SiteHeader from '../components/SiteHeader.astro';
import SiteFooter from '../components/SiteFooter.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en" class="scroll-smooth">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Cookie Policy - Rehman Veterinary Clinic</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Cookie Policy explaining how Rehman Veterinary Clinic uses cookies to improve website experience." />
</head>
<body class="bg-slate-50 text-slate-800 font-sans selection:bg-emerald-200 selection:text-emerald-900">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <a href="/" class="text-emerald-600 font-bold hover:underline mb-8 inline-block">&larr; Back to Home</a>
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Cookie Policy</h1>
    <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg">
      <p>Last updated: {new Date().toLocaleDateString()}</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">1. What are Cookies?</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">Cookies are small text files that are placed on your computer or mobile device when you visit a website. They are widely used to make websites work more efficiently, provide a better user experience, and supply analytical data to the website owners.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">2. How We Use Cookies</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">At <strong>Rehman Veterinary Clinic</strong>, we use cookies for the following purposes:</p>
      <ul class="list-disc ml-6 mb-4">
        <li><strong>Essential Cookies:</strong> Required to enable core website functionality such as our online booking system and shop cart logic.</li>
        <li><strong>Analytics Cookies:</strong> We use Google Analytics (gtag.js) to understand how visitors interact with our website, which pages are most popular, and how we can improve our services. These cookies collect data anonymously.</li>
        <li><strong>Preference Cookies:</strong> Used to remember your selections (e.g., dismissing banners or retaining basic session state) for your next visit.</li>
      </ul>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">3. Managing Cookies</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">You can instruct your browser to refuse all cookies or to indicate when a cookie is being sent. Most browsers allow you to control cookies through their settings preferences. However, if you do not accept cookies, you may not be able to use some portions of our website, such as the checkout process.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mt-8 mb-4">4. Updates to this Policy</h2>
      <p class="mb-4">We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time in order to reflect changes to the cookies we use or for other operational, legal, or regulatory reasons. Please revisit this page regularly to stay informed.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
